Package: peekaboo
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Peekaboo contributors <noreply@github.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Hesam-deb/peekaboo
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-opencv (>= 4.8), python3-numpy, python3-cryptography, python3-gi, gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.5), libpam0g (>= 1.4), libpam-runtime, libsystemd0, systemd, polkitd | policykit-1
Recommends: gjs, gnome-shell
Description: infrared face unlock for laptops
 Peekaboo unlocks the lock screen, the login screen, sudo and system prompts
 by looking at you, on laptops with an infrared (Windows Hello) camera.
 .
 It recognises your face only by the light of the camera's own strobing
 emitter, checks that you are paying attention, and can ask for a small turn
 of the head. Animations in GNOME follow your head.
